<<<
wash. The rivals wash-hand-stand, washing-stand, & wash-stand, are all in themselves justifiable, but it would be well to be rid of two of them. The first is obviously cumbrous, & there is no reason for preferring the longer second to the shorter third, especially with (Moab is my) wash-pot, wash-house, & washtub, waiting to welcome washstand, which is recommended.
===
**wash.** The rivals *wash-hand-stand, washing-stand,* & *wash-stand,* are all in themselves justifiable, but it would be well to be rid of two of them. The first is obviously cumbrous, & there is no reason for preferring the longer second to the shorter third, especially with *(Moab is my) wash-pot, wash-house,* & *washtub,* waiting to welcome *wash-stand,* which is recommended.
>>>

